	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "DIP-4 with surface-mount lead form, 9.53 mm row spacing (KiCad SMDIP-4_W9.53mm). For TLP627: 1 LED anode, 2 LED cathode, 3 emitter, 4 collector - the same part as the main board's four optos; a through-hole TLP627 lands here with its leads splayed flat. The silk bar marks pin 1. Mounted on the BACK: geometry mirrored in X from the KiCad library original, graphics on B.* layers.")
